            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Descriptions: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Dashboard - Distinct Count of Ownership: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>illustrates the distinct count of opportunity in each oppty stage</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Dashboard - Average days of Ownership:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>illustrates the average days of ownership of a opportunity that a  user has taken over  </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Metrics: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Lead Converted Date: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>Date when a lead that has converted into an account</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Oppty Change Date: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>Date when change of opportunity owner</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Data only show: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>lead created date on or after 2023-01-01; </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>leads created by id in </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>(&apos;0056900000AVz3YAAT&apos;, &apos;0056900000CRtp2AAD&apos;, &apos;0056900000BV0qnAAD&apos;, &apos;0056900000BUli5AAD&apos;, &apos;0056900000BSL0IAAX&apos;)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>lead status converted; </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>business type in &apos;New Business&apos;, &apos;Win Back&apos; ; </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>opportunity stage </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>NOT</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'> in &apos;Closed Won&apos; , &apos;Closed Lost&apos;; </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>vertical in &apos;Restaurant&apos;; </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
